    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβρᾰβεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>give judgement against</i> one <i>as</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραβεύς</span>, and so, <i>deprive</i>
			one <i>of the prize, deprive</i> one <i>of one's right</i>, c.
			acc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Col.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.399
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ Μειδίου καταβραβευθέντα</span>
			<i>being cast in his suit</i> by means of Meidias, Test. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.93
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4512
			</span></i>B<i><span class="en">
				58
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen., <i>rule over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γῆ κ. τῶν λοιπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					344.29
				</span></i>
			.</div>
